[{"title":"乙巳初春午门待漏","author":"卢宁","text":"密旨传朱燎，朝仪蹙锦璋。\n紫垣星乍烂，琼苑炬争光。\n驰道沿无逸，阍人俟未央。\n缙云千笏正，朝日一竿强。\n宫暖游鳷鹊，池温浴凤凰。\n雪消墀草绿，晴映阁烟黄。\n恍见端龙衮，俄宣罢鹭行。\n大夫归画省，圣主览弹章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9834,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留都元旦瞻天排律四十句","author":"卢宁","text":"宝历尊王正，天门布宪章。\n九衢歌作极，四海仰垂裳。\n待漏趋青琐，匡时上皂囊。\n六图纷献籍，八彩独当阳。\n梐枑彤铺丽，昭容紫袖长。\n和风间雉尾，瑞霭覆鹓行。\n日绕双龙衮，云扶两凤翔。\n天颜瞻舜表，春色醉尧浆。\n苍玉仪初佩，黄钟声正扬。\n问釐前御席，受计坐明堂。\n拊髀情何切，推心道自将。\n孝思亲庙藻，公籍拥郊桑。\n倏见樱桃荐，旋歌杕杜章。\n近臣知霁喜，陪省爱蕃康。\n意怿周京燕，身熏汉署香。\n辰猷惭黼黻，国度俯劻勷。\n买宅依东阙，分幡俨未央。\n帘栊通御气，花木被宸光。\n岁事饶三礼，农祥足万厢。\n临朝崇栗陆，敷治迈虞唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9835,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留邸春斋即事","author":"卢宁","text":"卜居密迩双龙阙，举目瞻依五凤楼。\n风静宫云连粉署，日迟梁燕掠金沟。\n衔恩剩似沾春宴，入梦频惊报晓筹。\n远近山河环帝辇，方隅文轨会宸猷。\n陵园葱郁閒貔虎，阊阖清虚忆冕旒。\n北极网维称大备，南畿仪典绝相侔。\n赤心补衮惟天老，靖节安边仗世侯。\n领部直司钱谷计，忧时还悉甲兵谋。\n圣明谟烈全超汉，宗社灵长准配周。\n何用闻鸡狂午夜，更烦击楫矢中流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9836,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"螺西小景","author":"卢宁","text":"买宅古来求远俗，近山今得赋閒居。\n松椽石磴封晴雾，野鹿岩鸡驯砌除。\n紫蕨漫随黄秫种，金芝还共白云锄。\n月临樽底腾腾上，气绕关前焰焰舒。\n风雅直宗陶靖节，文章都学马相如。\n百年英俊赚唐制，半世功名付贾闾。\n华发萧萧秋自缟，素怀拍拍谷同虚。\n长歌谢脁惊人句，高读柴桑隐士书。\n此日霞瞻追去鹄，是谁株守愧飞鸒。\n驱车拟入螺西境，系马先寻班固庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9837,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大观桥泛舟","author":"陶益","text":"野旷望无穷，清江对落枫。\n客船冲浪白，渔火入波红。\n击楫惊沙鸟，题桥愧海翁。\n因思庞处士，便卧鹿门东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9838,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴杨子宅观太史文衡山诗草","author":"陶益","text":"芳樽锦席对羊欣，仿佛如瞻白练裙。\n摛藻纵横攒鸟迹，挥毫灿烂簇星文。\n金门玉漏怜方朔，识字愁贫薄子云。\n太史才华谁得似，每言吴下即慇勤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9839,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江边送客二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"潮长江边已放船，离情犹系柳条烟。\n倚楼客子今何在，南浦歌残益惘然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9840,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江边送客二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"青蛇出袖尚依依，忽看仙舟一叶飞。\n箫鼓不闻人已远，暮云烟树正熹微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9841,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夕与宋石坡赋别","author":"陶益","text":"罢读悲秋赋，分携出古城。\n江山离别地，灯火弟兄情。\n日暮砧声急，云寒雁阵惊。\n匆匆言不尽，郁悒对长庚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9842,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江门晚渡","author":"陶益","text":"薄暮扁舟出钓沙，数林毛竹护烟霞。\n濯缨一路随明月，恍见庐山旧隐家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9843,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀不寐作三子诗三首 其一 唐子定江","author":"陶益","text":"忆昔赴选场，与君俱少小。\n同心畹中兰，比翼云中鸟。\n作赋拟太冲，学书兼王赵。\n唐音近若何，怀哉山中晓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9844,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀不寐作三子诗三首 其二 关子鹤门","author":"陶益","text":"萧冈关上路，望之阻且长。\n眷言念良友，辗转热中肠。\n文驾骖两汉，标格自昂昂。\n气象底相似，潇洒贺知章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀不寐作三子诗三首 其三 郑子浚泉","author":"陶益","text":"谷口有佳人，才华席上珍。\n至理多妙悟，丽藻罕其伦。\n昔年同笔砚，今日隔江津。\n念之不可即，梦寐徒相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭王默斋先生","author":"陶益","text":"驾驻羊城日，筵开雀舫时。\n披襟增慷慨，晞发笑支离。\n业慕夔龙盛，才追贾董奇。\n哲人胡遽逝，吾道重堪悲。\n洒泪闻蒿里，羞蘋奠楚辞。\n枫林遥引望，三叹有馀思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上曲","author":"陶益","text":"荡桨横塘里，寻芳薄暮时。\n荷花明结子，藕孔暗成丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与陈锡泉舅氏泛舟","author":"陶益","text":"背郭嚣尘寂，开船景物遥。\n鸥飞閒白昼，鹤叫彻青霄。\n刚说潮通岸，俄惊水漫桥。\n临流同击楫，幽兴未全消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9849,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"多病苦雨奉答郑浚泉","author":"陶益","text":"看云迁，看雨眠。\n菜甲冲寒出，蜂房背湿悬。\n多病音书谁为寄，旧游踪迹尔堪怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9850,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三水夜别兵宪莫葵山公是公宴留草书因赋","author":"陶益","text":"驻节江山静，开船蜡炬明。\n樽前方染翰，楼上已深更。\n月吐朱旗闪，风生画角鸣。\n酒酣还起舞，况复听鸡声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9851,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李中冈入京","author":"陶益","text":"祖帐三城路，春风万里程。\n王孙俄已别，芳草若为情。\n丽日生书剑，垂柳拂旆旌。\n长安怜得意，遮莫马蹄轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厌雨寄梁仲房二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"檐前日夜纷纷雨，槛外园林处处萤。\n徙倚独怜词客远，满途兰若为谁馨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厌雨寄梁仲房二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"深雾笼云飞石燕，半晴又雨弄蒲蓑。\n山斋亦有冲泥望，青鸟不来思正多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过白沙里","author":"陶益","text":"湖空鹤散几经春，惟有青山恋旧人。\n庐阜荒凉还作伴，楚台岑寂故相亲。\n紫芝地迥浮烟霭，碧玉楼虚对海滨。\n怅念昔贤心欲折，莫言忧道更忧贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过秫坡钓台二首得清字 其一","author":"陶益","text":"都会江边望，荒凉旧秫粳。\n树瓢藏野色，风笠混秋声。\n夜夜烟空暝，年年水自清。\n羊裘如尚在，期与共逃名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9856,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过秫坡钓台二首得清字 其二","author":"陶益","text":"独步荒台上，应怜泻濑清。\n坐来消俗虑，钓罢濯尘缨。\n水咽石相语，波漂鱼不惊。\n仰看今夜月，还此为谁明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9857,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜怀谭步铉","author":"陶益","text":"昔年曾共听秋声，高阁藜灯一样明。\n今夜独含悬榻愧，紫微空照月华清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐闻笛","author":"陶益","text":"与客谈玄坐林樾，见童烹茗荐薇蕨。\n笛声何处风送来，文园尽绕关山月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"避喧樾墩得关鹤门所寄京回途中见怀之作用韵奉答","author":"陶益","text":"隔海归来渡晚流，冥冥细雨霎然收。\n居人同对屋梁月，游子独栖何处洲。\n远树停云仍在望，幽怀逸兴未曾休。\n五湖大隐如相访，鹤氅纶巾定买舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李春官尊翁还家二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"班饯临流酒半醺，棹歌渔笛谩相闻。\n悬知此后兰台客，时向飞鸿望白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李春官尊翁还家二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"凤诰楼船秋气清，蘋花推缆出江明。\n还家若羡莼鲈美，须记仙郎禄养情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与王青萝先生江门阻风二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"翠竹江村古渡边，冥鸿数点没寒烟。\n濛濛浦口渔灯乱，风急舟横只醉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与王青萝先生江门阻风二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"终风带雨摧舟楫，逆浪通潮涨海波。\n信宿江门如有待，昔贤曾此钓烟蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"命子篇戏呈岳丈张太守","author":"陶益","text":"明我曾祖，谥忠烈臣。\n飞霜两浙，祀典彬彬。\n至于大父，藩臬时陈。\n以劳定国，庙食维新。\n及尔斯祖，绪缵孝纯。\n簪缨世业，创自其身。\n嗟予寡昧，博褐綦巾。\n亦既抱子，闻道未真。\n命名期尔，令德显亲。\n尔其勉之，庶几能人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游陆熙斋莫鹤严庄次杨天泉韵","author":"陶益","text":"万竹青青拥钓台，遥闻鸡犬隔云隈。\n树笼日色凉衣袂，风送潮声入酒杯。\n新旧比邻须共好，迂疏野客拟重来。\n桃花莫锁通幽处，三径还应取次开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书梁浮山扇景梦中作","author":"陶益","text":"舟泊黄芦草，风零白雁霜。\n此时閒怅望，何处是家乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉答欧大仑见怀之作","author":"陶益","text":"绝俗仑山上，离群紫水东。\n长年遥念汝，竟日望来鸿。\n野菊篱边艳，霜枫郭外红。\n可怜秋色好，樽酒与谁同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜别孙小渠归南都二首得悬字 其一","author":"陶益","text":"迢递金陵道，苍茫二月天。\n还家应有乐，送客最堪怜。\n舞剑星光动，张灯榻影悬。\n骊歌未终竟，挥手各风烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜别孙小渠归南都二首得悬字 其二","author":"陶益","text":"轻风来浦口，弱柳动江边。\n客舫帆初系，归心月共悬。\n分携惟此夜，庆会在何年。\n独有雕龙约，长安赠马鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何善山先生赴工部","author":"陶益","text":"别路攀留切，离筵鼓吹雄。\n此时沾化雨，何日坐春风。\n鹤扰行台下，凫飞画省中。\n仰怀良夜月，千里幸相同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜内弟张蒙泉惠鹤四首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"眷此青田鸟，来居小樾林。\n欲鸣先硕影，谁识九霄心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜内弟张蒙泉惠鹤四首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"眷此青田鸟，相看意未欢。\n共期齐六翮，大叫出云端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜内弟张蒙泉惠鹤四首 其三","author":"陶益","text":"眷此青田鸟，犹含碧落情。\n不能为若主，深愧九皋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜内弟张蒙泉惠鹤四首 其四","author":"陶益","text":"眷此青田鸟，丹砂顶亦奇。\n他时词客访，迟尔报吾知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春迓琴士出广","author":"陶益","text":"贪赏珠江寺，快登镇海楼。\n携琴临水岸，待□上兰舟。\n春色浓于酒，烟光远接流。\n愿谐修褉伴，促膝傍林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与李逸士留别二首分韵得舟字 其一","author":"陶益","text":"行酒赋诗兴未休，谪仙临别又相留。\n棋声不断江村晚，风摺芦花傍客舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与李逸士留别二首分韵得舟字 其二","author":"陶益","text":"别路寒生欲暮秋，蓼蘋红白乱汀洲。\n江门此夕华灯望，疑是当年李郭舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友入京兼寄姻亲伦礼部","author":"陶益","text":"祖帐对芙蕖，清樽绿蚁虚。\n风烟凌岛屿，瞻眺欲萧疏。\n怕别浑无语，临行愿有书。\n因思伦穗石，辞赋汉相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"俞一木先生高尚乞休别后补赠","author":"陶益","text":"解组贪泉石，抽簪恋钓筒。\n白莲怀社内，黄菊想篱中。\n廊庙情虽笃，江湖梦已通。\n乞归如邴涣，招隐羡梁鸿。\n桃李瞻依切，冠裳出饯同。\n遗荣名愈重，拜送意何穷。\n桂楫摇波碧，蒲帆背日红。\n离颜搔短鬓，去思结深衷。\n一木飞霞迥，三鳣宿雾笼。\n追攀不可及，翘首仰高风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈北溪赴任省亲临别有赠","author":"陶益","text":"白沙翠竹古冈州，羡尔衣冠向此游。\n入境喜迎仙籍彦，趋庭应见海陵侯。\n龙光出匣星河动，鹢影摇波日夜浮。\n慷慨共期千万里，壮怀休倚仲宣楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"许吾野观竞渡诗二首索和为次之 其一","author":"陶益","text":"龙船出海竞相催，击楫中流亦壮哉。\n猛气已随飞浪急，雄心争喜夺标回。\n投湘角黍仍堪具，吊屈辞章未易裁。\n江畔往来人扰扰，不知谁负洛阳才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"许吾野观竞渡诗二首索和为次之 其二","author":"陶益","text":"乍雨初收潮欲平，遥闻隔浦有歌声。\n湖边过客依依望，桥上游人故故惊。\n忽见鹢浮波浪出，俄喧龙跃海涛生。\n酒阑尽日不归去，采采芙蓉还濯缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒林梧窗先生祠","author":"陶益","text":"不见林宗面，先抠孺子衣。\n名祠瞻俎豆，绛帐想光辉。\n洗砚池空在，藏书室已非。\n藓碑摩读罢，悽恻欲归依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"展墓归哀感","author":"陶益","text":"岁时瞻拜倍伤神，回首中庭泪满巾。\n斯道未闻缘底事，直惭温饱负吾亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺陆熙斋先生令弟新居","author":"陶益","text":"结庐偏喜近山城，中有幽栖若画成。\n花影不随流水去，月痕依旧浸溪明。\n壶觞杖屦浑堪乐，琴瑟埙篪亦并清。\n莫讶趋庭年最少，陆机吴下早知名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧侍御母李夫人贞节","author":"陶益","text":"慨息夫人节，冰壶一样清。\n凤帏虽乍合，鸾镜永孤明。\n锦诰承天宠，朱衣共子荣。\n台乌时哽咽，风木重含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧母陈节妇","author":"陶益","text":"誓从相国彦，节比共姜贤。\n束发怜中路，孤灯忆盛年。\n一经劳自授，三徙岂徒然。\n此母信难得，还应青史编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦白沙先生与予外祖陈洪斋翁至授予数言觉赋二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"二老因何梦里逢，虬髯鹤发尽仙容。\n至言餐后犹如见，月白堂虚五夜钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦白沙先生与予外祖陈洪斋翁至授予数言觉赋二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"紫芝眉宇共依依，手示青囊意已微。\n梦破自知还自愧，屋梁空见月斜辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9890,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江中晓泛有怀二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"晴光浮野外，曙色满江中。\n不见西方月，空瞻北斗鸿。\n鱼龙迎伏浪，舟楫击长风。\n有美家何在，瀰茫一水通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9891,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江中晓泛有怀二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"已阅通津路，犹闻报曙钟。\n閒情方欲遣，别兴转加浓。\n鲛室潭涎敛，蜃楼海市重。\n美人知不远，惆怅隔芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9892,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游宋皇陵二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"郊原望望皆禾黍，寝庙萧萧哭杜宇。\n藓碑读罢俯閒阶，月明初照青枫树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9893,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游宋皇陵二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"门掩藤萝岁月老，寂寞龙宫长青草。\n野人不解悲前朝，行歌互答松阴道。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9894,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过三忠祠","author":"陶益","text":"白浪浮孤国，青山托古祠。\n英雄今尚尔，胡虏竟何之。\n残垒荒烟断，寒云野径垂。\n因思岳武穆，心事愈凄其。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9895,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蔡先生旌奖卷","author":"陶益","text":"共学西山蔡子家，执经吾已愧侯芭。\n鱼龙夜雨争闻铎，桃李春风解作花。\n白发青毡推宦况，兰台柏府重声华。\n逢人且莫嗟迟暮，会拜鸾书庆未涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9896,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊戌秋谭少铉与诸贤父兄为予祈嗣大雁山赋此奉谢时予受室几四载矣","author":"陶益","text":"酌酒风前祷，敷文壁上留。\n山灵如有识，玉燕定相投。\n桂菊香将发，云霞翠欲流。\n辛勤谢使者，欣记此清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9897,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"僻居得关曼贞远寄用韵以迓之","author":"陶益","text":"庄家竹埤远近诃，沽酒树下对渔蓑。\n觉坐班荆市井隔，闻歌子夜离违多。\n书札昔负几回约，旆旌今能千里过。\n褰帏散帙喜不寐，月白纷纷悬薜萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9898,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳与诸友游圭峰二首时闻边报 其一","author":"陶益","text":"招携九日上圭峰，云拥禅关鸟道通。\n石室有僧谈桂父，玉台无地访芝童。\n黄花带露垂幽径，白雁鸣霜翼疾风。\n愁忆边尘秋又暮，独弹孤剑倚长空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":9899,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]